---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
import { product, status } from "../site";
---

<Page
  path="/host/"
  title="Host | kiln-vm"
  description="kiln-vm needs one Linux host with KVM on amd64 or arm64. kiln-vm doctor checks the host before you create anything."
>
  <Fragment slot="open">
    <div class="say">
      <div class="say__lead">
        <h1 class="say__title">Host</h1>
        <pre class="cmd">kiln-vm doctor</pre>
      </div>
      <p class="say__text">
        kiln-vm is a daemon, <code>kiln-vmd</code>, and a CLI that talks to it. The daemon runs on one Linux machine,
        keeps its state under <code>/var/lib/kiln-vm</code> and listens on <code>127.0.0.1:5456</code>.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="form form--lit kvm kvm--above" aria-hidden="true"><span class="kvm__dir">/dev/</span>kvm</p>
  </Fragment>

  <Fragment slot="ground">
    <p class="form form--pressed kvm kvm--below" aria-hidden="true"><span class="kvm__dir">/dev/</span>kvm</p>
    <div class="notes">
      <section class="note">
        <h2 class="note__title">What it needs</h2>
        <p>
          A Linux host on amd64 or arm64 with <code>/dev/kvm</code>. <code>doctor</code> checks KVM, Firecracker, the
          guest kernel and the host tools, and warns when disk or memory is short.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="note">
        <h2 class="note__title">How much it runs</h2>
        <p>
          By default, 8 VMs at a time, sharing 8 vCPUs and 8192 MB of memory. Stopped VMs use none of that, so you can
          keep more than you run.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="note note--end">
        <h2 class="note__title">{status}</h2>
        <p>{product} is free and will be open source. There is nothing to install today.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </Fragment>
</Page>

<style>
  .kvm {
    --fit: 5.58;
    --bearing: 0.031em;
    --waterline: 0.28em;
  }

  .kvm--above {
    margin-bottom: calc(-0.24em - var(--waterline));
  }

  .kvm--below {
    margin-top: calc(var(--waterline) - 0.89em);
  }

  @media (max-width: 44em) {
    .kvm {
      --fit: 2.459;
      --bearing: 0.063em;
    }

    .kvm__dir {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
